WEBVTT

00:04:58.169 --> 00:05:00.004
And in what will make my mom happy,

00:05:00.046 --> 00:05:03.841
they are also reporting improvements
in their academic grades.

00:05:06.135 --> 00:05:09.555
Mental health is not a Kenyan problem.

00:05:10.181 --> 00:05:12.308
It is not an African problem.

00:05:12.808 --> 00:05:14.727
This is a global problem.

00:05:14.769 --> 00:05:17.730
We need big ideas to tackle this problem.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:21.359
And our case for optimism
is that our youth-oriented,

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:25.613
community-focused model can be a template
for the rest of the world.

00:05:27.198 --> 00:05:29.450
One other early memory from childhood

00:05:29.492 --> 00:05:32.078
is a story that my grandmother,
Yunita, told me.